WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.373 --> 00:00:03.318
Shows itself to you that Bill Smith

00:00:03.318 --> 00:00:06.784
didn't take the proper care of Minnie the way he could have.

00:00:06.784 --> 00:00:12.479
To have her sink and die, take her head rights and her land.

00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:15.122
That oil, which should go to her sisters, your wife.

00:00:15.122 --> 00:00:17.849
Well, he's taking money that by rights should go to Mollie.

00:00:21.209 --> 00:00:22.001
The mother, Lizzie.

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:31.133
She's not in good shape.

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:32.283
She won't last.

00:00:34.195 --> 00:00:36.244
Most Osage don't live past 50.

00:00:37.617 --> 00:00:41.061
When these women die, with how Osage suffer from illness,

00:00:41.061 --> 00:00:45.291
you have to make it the head rights come to you.

00:00:45.291 --> 00:00:46.918
You see?

